From f522c25f194f02311c59702747df5bb2ec66fe55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JingMatrix <jingmatrix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:20:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/47] Add the control channel and route by profile

The interceptors become pure engines driven by the daemon over an abstract unix socket. common/control.cpp serves length-prefixed JSON config pushes, staged into one reference-TA instance per profile and swapped atomically; common/json is a small no-throw reader. keymint routes creation by ATTESTATION_APPLICATION_ID, keystore by uid, and operations run on a default TA since blobs are cross-decryptable. entry() now just starts the server and installs the hook.
